specs/hal-engine-config-hooks/spec.md:29:- A reported round still contributes when another round has no usage, while a turn whose rounds never report usage passes `undefined` to `afterModelResponse` ([validated by: counts reported rounds while leaving a turn with no reported usage undefined](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L67)).
